{"n":93,"name":"Ad-Duha","ar":"الضحى","frn":"","place":"Mecquoise","count":11,"ayahs":[{"t":"وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","fr":"Par le Jour Montant","tr":"Wa Ađ-Đuha","w":[["وَ|P|P|PREF|LEM:و","ٱل|P|DET|PREF|LEM:ال","ضُّحَىٰ|N|ROOT:ضحو|LEM:ضُحًى|M|GEN"]]},{"t":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ","fr":"Et par la nuit quand elle couvre tout","tr":"Wa Al-Layli 'Idha Saja","w":[["وَ|P|CONJ|PREF|LEM:و","ٱلَّ|P|DET|PREF|LEM:ال","يْلِ|N|ROOT:ليل|LEM:لَيْل|M|GEN"],["إِذَا|N|T|LEM:إِذا"],["سَجَىٰ|V|PERF|VF:1|ROOT:سجو|LEM:سَجَى|3MS"]]},{"t":"مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ","fr":"Ton Seigneur ne t'a ni abandonné, ni détesté","tr":"Ma Wadda`aka Rabbuka Wa Ma Qala","w":[["مَا|P|NEG|LEM:ما"],["وَدَّعَ|V|PERF|VF:2|ROOT:ودع|LEM:وَدَّعَ|3MS","كَ|N|PRON|SUFF|2MS"],["رَبُّ|N|ROOT:ربب|LEM:رَبّ|M|NOM","كَ|N|PRON|SUFF|2MS"],["وَ|P|CONJ|PREF|LEM:و","مَا|P|NEG|LEM:ما"],["قَلَىٰ|V|PERF|VF:1|ROOT:قلي|LEM:قَلَى|3MS"]]},{"t":"وَلَلْءَاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌۭ لَّكَ مِنَ ٱلْأُولَىٰ","fr":"La vie dernière t'est, certes, meilleure que la vie présente","tr":"Wa Lal'akhiratu Khayrun Laka Mina Al-'Ula","w":[["وَ|P|REM|PREF|LEM:و","لَ|P|EMPH|PREF|LEM:ل","لْ|P|DET|PREF|LEM:ال","ءَاخِرَةُ|N|ROOT:أخر|LEM:آخِر|FS|NOM"],["خَيْرٌ|N|ROOT:خير|LEM:خَيْر|MS|INDEF|NOM"],["لَّ|P|P|PREF|LEM:ل","كَ|N|PRON|2MS"],["مِنَ|P|P|LEM:مِن"],["ٱلْ|P|DET|PREF|LEM:ال","أُولَىٰ|N|ROOT:أول|LEM:أَوَّل|F|GEN"]]},{"t":"وَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","fr":"Ton Seigneur t'accordera certes [Ses faveurs], et alors tu seras satisfait","tr":"Wa Lasawfa Yu`tika Rabbuka Fatarđa","w":[["وَ|P|REM|PREF|LEM:و","لَ|P|EMPH|PREF|LEM:ل","سَوْفَ|P|FUT|LEM:سَوْف"],["يُعْطِي|V|IMPF|VF:4|ROOT:عطو|LEM:أَعْطَى|3MS|MOOD:IND","كَ|N|PRON|SUFF|2MS"],["رَبُّ|N|ROOT:ربب|LEM:رَبّ|M|NOM","كَ|N|PRON|SUFF|2MS"],["فَ|P|CONJ|PREF|LEM:ف","تَرْضَىٰٓ|V|IMPF|VF:1|ROOT:رضو|LEM:رَضِيَ|2MS|MOOD:IND"]]},{"t":"أَلَمْ يَجِدْكَ يَتِيمًۭا فَـَٔاوَىٰ","fr":"Ne t'a-t-Il pas trouvé orphelin? Alors Il t'a accueilli","tr":"Alam Yajidka Yatimaan Fa'awa","w":[["أَ|N|INTG|PREF|LEM:أ","لَمْ|P|NEG|LEM:لَم"